 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's main export partners are Germany, France, and Belgium.",
  "The total exports in 2025 amount to 16.25 billion euros, with Germany receiving 3.91 billion euros or 24.1% of exports.",
  "France and Belgium follow with 3.10 billion euros (19.1%) and 2.14 billion euros (13.1%) respectively.",
  "The top three export partners together account for 56.3% of Luxembourg's exports.",
  "The data is in current euros and includes 3.3% confidential exports and 2.7% undisclosed partners, which are not assigned to specific countries."
 ],
